<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.handle.burns ~ a Handle's end: its nym stops here

`lares handle burn` ends the persona's Handle: readers refuse its nym after. The seated key buries it, or with `--from-persona` the persona buries it from above (an owner-burn).

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ burn · owner

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`burn` params=`~ burn under the seated key`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`owner` params=`from-persona/true ~ burn from the persona`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ persona · from-persona

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`persona` params=`takes/index ~ the persona whose Handle acts; absent, the store door's default`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`from-persona` params=`~ the persona burns it from above, an owner-burn`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`hand` params=`who/seat-or-hand key/handle-head ~ the store door signs on the WHO board under the Handle's key`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ store-refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`store-refused` params=`~ the store door refused; the line names why`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ burned

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`burned` params=`exit/0 ~ the burned card's glamour and nym`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares handle burn

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares handle burn]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

